# What `ci-runner.sh seed` puts in the read-only seed every job sees.
#
# One tool per line. A version a workflow asks for that is not listed still
# works: the job downloads it into its own container and it dies there. Listing
# it only makes it warm. Bump a line here, then `ci-runner.sh seed`.
#
#   node <exact version>          what setup-node would put in the tool cache
#   playwright <exact version>    the browsers `npx playwright install chromium`
#                                 fetches for that version of playwright-core
#
node 24.21.0
playwright 1.61.1
